{
  "title": "sekans_nobet_harami",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:c1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Nogay",
      "text": "Sorhan... In the night I discovered four unshod horse tracks along the forest boundary. The notch in the hoof marks belongs to the Red Crow outlaws."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:c2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Sorhan",
      "text": "I know it, Nogay... The colts in the stable whinnied in distress at midnight; they smelled no wolf, but the stench of brigands. We must keep sharp vigil."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Sound the alarm for the garrison horsemen and the archers on the tower; double the night patrol!"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "No need for panic; track the prints, but do not alarm the townspeople."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Nogay",
      "text": "I saddle my mount at once, gatekeeper! We shall lay the first ambush on the steppe; they shall not draw near the portal."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Sorhan",
      "text": "I shall track their trail and lay deadfalls, master. If a twig snaps in the pine woods, my spear will find its mark."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act1",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1750.0, -90.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
